WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.090 --> 00:00:02.490
- Is it, I mean, was it,
like, intimidating at all?

00:00:02.490 --> 00:00:04.260
Like, to work with him or just inspiring?

00:00:04.260 --> 00:00:05.992
Was it cool? (laughs)

00:00:05.992 --> 00:00:06.825
(audience and Sofia laughs)

00:00:06.825 --> 00:00:08.996
- [Kelly] Tell me more. (laughs)

00:00:08.996 --> 00:00:09.829
- [Sophia] Hmm.
- [Sofia] Hmm.

00:00:09.829 --> 00:00:10.662
- I'm just curious.

00:00:10.662 --> 00:00:11.940
- I don't think I was intimidated.

00:00:11.940 --> 00:00:13.651
I didn't really have
time to be intimidated.

00:00:13.651 --> 00:00:15.180
(Kelly laughing)

00:00:15.180 --> 00:00:16.170
And there's always something to learn,

00:00:16.170 --> 00:00:18.690
whether your co-star's
famous or not famous,

00:00:18.690 --> 00:00:20.200
or legend or not,

00:00:20.200 --> 00:00:22.080
I think there's always
something to be learned.

00:00:22.080 --> 00:00:23.211
- How about you?
How did you feel?

00:00:23.211 --> 00:00:25.851
- I was the exact opposite.
(Kelly and guests laugh)

00:00:25.851 --> 00:00:27.330
I was, like, freaking out.

00:00:27.330 --> 00:00:28.530
I mean, look at them, like,

00:00:28.530 --> 00:00:31.570
I've grown up watching the
both of you, and I tried so...

00:00:31.570 --> 00:00:32.746
- I'm not that old.
(everyone laughs)

00:00:32.746 --> 00:00:35.670
- [Sofia] (laughing) Yes.
- Like, from a few years ago.

00:00:35.670 --> 00:00:37.827
- [Sofia] Exactly.
- Yeah.

00:00:37.827 --> 00:00:40.290
- And I tried to play it so cool.

00:00:40.290 --> 00:00:43.356
I was like, "Hey Kerry, whazzup?"

00:00:43.356 --> 00:00:44.357
Like...
(Charlize and Kerry laugh)

00:00:44.357 --> 00:00:45.190
Casual.

00:00:45.190 --> 00:00:46.023
- [Kelly] Casual.
- Yeah.

00:00:46.023 --> 00:00:47.580
But inside I'm like literally shaking.

00:00:47.580 --> 00:00:48.720
And I just remember, like,

00:00:48.720 --> 00:00:51.720
the first day on set
I had with you, Kerry,

00:00:51.720 --> 00:00:54.027
you touched my face in one of the takes

00:00:54.027 --> 00:00:54.860
(Kerry laughs)

00:00:54.860 --> 00:00:55.860
and I literally went to my parents,

00:00:55.860 --> 00:00:57.904
I was like, "I'm never
washing my face again."

00:00:57.904 --> 00:01:01.774
(audience laughs and claps)
(Kerry laughs)

00:01:01.774 --> 00:01:03.177
- I love that.
- Oh, that's so cute.

00:01:03.177 --> 00:01:04.973
- [Kelly] I love that.
- [Sofia] Yeah.

